{"seq":2,"slug":"fx-gain-loss","title":"汇兑损益记账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/refund-tax-adjustment/multicurrency-refund-fx/fx-gain-loss","wordCount":3079,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"汇兑损益记账\">汇兑损益记账</h1><p>上一篇确立了一个默认做法：退款按原支付金额精确逆转。如果全世界只有一种货币，这个做法会让退款在会计上完全干净——入账多少，冲回多少，差额为零。但跨境退款恰恰发生在多种货币之间，账户里的金额不可能总是精确相等。这一篇讲的就是那些相等不了的差额：它们是什么、落在哪个科目、怎么算、以及为什么绝不能把它们和税务冲减混在一起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>汇兑损益（foreign exchange gain/loss）是「同一笔经济事项在不同时点用不同汇率折算所产生的差额」的会计表达。</strong> 它不是错账，不是手续费，也不是折扣——它是汇率变动的必然结果，必须被识别、计量并记入正确的科目。</p>\n<p>在退款场景下，汇兑损益的产生需要一个明确的触发结构：<strong>一笔负债（应付退款）的记账金额，与它的结算金额，用记账币种衡量时不相等</strong>。用公式说，如果退款负债在确认时以汇率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 折算为记账币种金额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，实际支付时以汇率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 折算为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_2 = P_1 \\cdot e_2/e_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则差额</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = P_2 - P_1 = P_1 \\left(\\frac{e_2}{e_1} - 1\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>就是汇兑损益。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是汇兑损失（付出去更多记账币种），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是汇兑收益。</p>\n<p>关键的前提是：<strong>必须有「负债确认」与「负债结算」两个不同时点</strong>。如果退款在确认的同时就支付（同一时点、同一汇率），差额恒为零。而现实中这两个时点必然分离——退款从「确定要退」到「钱实际出去」之间有审批、有税务凭证等待、有支付通道处理，这个时间差即使只有几天，也足以让汇率变动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单入账 汇率 e0] --&gt; B[确认应收账款 记账币种 P0]&#10;  B --&gt; C[收款 汇率 e1]&#10;  C --&gt; D[已实现汇兑损益 P0→P1 收款日]&#10;  D --&gt; E[买家退货 确认退款负债]&#10;  E --&gt; F[负债折算 汇率 e2 记账币种 L2]&#10;  F --&gt; G[贷记通知与税务冲减 用原单口径]&#10;  G --&gt; H[实际退款支付 汇率 e3]&#10;  H --&gt; I[负债结算 差额 = L3 - L2]&#10;  I --&gt; J[已实现汇兑损益 记入损益科目]&#10;  J --&gt; K[与税务冲减分列 不混入销项税]\">graph TD\n  A[订单入账 汇率 e0] --&gt; B[确认应收账款 记账币种 P0]\n  B --&gt; C[收款 汇率 e1]\n  C --&gt; D[已实现汇兑损益 P0→P1 收款日]\n  D --&gt; E[买家退货 确认退款负债]\n  E --&gt; F[负债折算 汇率 e2 记账币种 L2]\n  F --&gt; G[贷记通知与税务冲减 用原单口径]\n  G --&gt; H[实际退款支付 汇率 e3]\n  H --&gt; I[负债结算 差额 = L3 - L2]\n  I --&gt; J[已实现汇兑损益 记入损益科目]\n  J --&gt; K[与税务冲减分列 不混入销项税]</pre><p>图中的时点序列值得细看：这里实际上有<strong>四到五个</strong>汇率时点——下单（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、收款（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、退货确认负债（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、退款支付（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。每一对相邻时点之间都可能产生差额，而这些差额在会计上的性质不同：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_0 \\to e_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是应收账款的汇兑损益（收款时的），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_1 \\to e_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_1 \\to e_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是退款负债的汇兑损益。<strong>同一笔订单可能同时产生多条汇兑损益记录</strong>，它们分属不同科目、不同期间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"已实现与未实现-两种损益的区分\">已实现与未实现：两种损益的区分</h2><p>会计上必须严格区分这两类，因为它们的报表处理与税务影响不同。</p>\n<p><strong>未实现汇兑损益（unrealized）</strong>：期末对外币货币性项目（应收账款、应付账款、外币存款）按期末汇率重新折算所产生的差额。它没有现金流动，只是一个重估，计入当期损益但在部分准则下可递延。对退款的影响是：如果一笔退款负债在资产负债表日尚未支付，它要按期末汇率重估，产生未实现损益；等实际支付时，再结算出已实现损益。</p>\n<p><strong>已实现汇兑损益（realized）</strong>：实际收付发生时的差额，有现金流动。退款支付完成的那一刻，退款负债的已实现损益就确定了。</p>\n<p>对系统的含义是：<strong>退款负债必须是一个外币货币性项目，必须在期末参与重估</strong>。如果系统只用「记账币种」记录退款负债（在确认时就把外币金额折成记账币种并丢弃原币信息），那么期末就无法重估，未实现损益会丢失，报表上表现为损益不平——差额会在支付时才一次性出现，且金额可能很大。正确的做法是负债以<strong>原币金额 + 原币币种</strong>记账，记账币种金额是它的折算表示。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>记账方式</th>\n<th>期末处理</th>\n<th>结算处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>退款负债</td>\n<td>原币金额 + 币种 + 折算记账金额</td>\n<td>按期末汇率重估 → 未实现损益</td>\n<td>按支付日汇率结算 → 已实现损益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收款（原交易）</td>\n<td>同上（应收账款）</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税务冲减额</td>\n<td>按税务申报口径折算</td>\n<td>不重估（税务口径固定）</td>\n<td>不结算（无现金流）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付通道成本</td>\n<td>记账币种</td>\n<td>不重估</td>\n<td>不结算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行是必须记住的：<strong>税务冲减额不参与汇兑重估</strong>。原因是税务申报的金额一旦确定（按申报口径汇率折算后进入申报表），它就固定了，不会因为后续汇率变动而被修改——除非走修正申报。把税务冲减额也拿去重估会把税务数据与会计数据搅在一起，导致申报表与总账两处都错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落位-汇兑损益记在哪里\">落位：汇兑损益记在哪里</h2><p>汇兑损益在损益表上的位置依准则而定，但退款场景下的<strong>归集维度</strong>是工程上更实际的问题。建议按以下三个维度归集：</p>\n<p><strong>按币种对（currency pair）</strong>：EUR/SEK、USD/BRL、EUR/PLN 等。这是最基本的维度，用于分析哪些币种的敞口最大。它也是财务做外汇对冲决策的输入——如果 EUR/SEK 的退款损益持续为负，说明该币种的退款敞口需要提前锁定汇率。</p>\n<p><strong>按业务事件类型</strong>：收款损益、退款损益、结算损益。区分这三者很重要，因为它们的时间结构与可控性不同。退款损益的一个特点是它在<strong>退货率上升时放大</strong>——退货越多，退款负债越多，汇率敞口的规模越大，损益波动越剧烈。这个特征让「高退货率品类 + 弱币种」成为一个需要专门监控的组合。</p>\n<p><strong>按市场/主体</strong>：不同市场的记账主体可能不同（多国子公司结构），汇兑损益要在正确的法人主体上归集，否则合并报表时会出现跨主体的抵销问题。</p>\n<p>三维归集会让数据量变大，因此实际做法通常是<strong>明细按币种对与事件类型记录，市场维度通过订单关联推导</strong>，而不是在每个维度上都建索引。</p>\n<p>关于税率变动的市场（如土耳其、阿根廷这类高通胀经济体）还有一层特殊处理：这些市场可能适用<strong>恶性通货膨胀会计</strong>（IAS 29），汇兑损益要与通胀调整分开列示。这不是本 hub 的主题，但设计数据模型时要留出「通胀调整」与「汇兑损益」两个独立字段，以免将来无法拆分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么不能和税务冲减混在一起\">为什么不能和税务冲减混在一起</h2><p>这是本篇要重点敲打的一点，因为它在实际系统里非常常见。</p>\n<p>想象一个实现：退款流程里计算「应退买家金额」，然后把这笔钱拆成净额与税额，税额用于税务冲减，净额用于资金退款；然后为了「简化」，把折算产生的差额也塞进退款额里，让总额自洽。这个做法会在三处出问题：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，税务冲减金额会被污染。</strong> 如果退款总额里混入了汇率差额，那么按比例拆出的税额就包含了与交易无关的部分，冲减的销项税不是这笔交易本应冲减的税。审计时无法解释「为什么这笔跨币种退款冲减的税比原票对应部分多」。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，资金退款额与贷记通知金额不一致。</strong> 贷记通知是税务凭证，它的金额必须等于被冲减交易的金额；而资金退款额如果被汇率差额调整过，两者就对不上。三方对账会持续报差异，且这类差异会被误判为计量性差异，见 <a href=\"../tax-adjustment-voucher/refund-tax-reconcile\">退款-发票-税务三方对账</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，损益科目错位。</strong> 汇率差额记在「销售退回」里会虚增退款成本，记在「其他」里又无法分析敞口，两种都不对。</p>\n<p>正确的结构是<strong>三层分离</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>币种口径</th>\n<th>科目</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易层</td>\n<td>退款金额（= 原单金额）</td>\n<td>原支付币种</td>\n<td>收入冲减 / 销售退回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税务层</td>\n<td>税额冲减额</td>\n<td>原单冻结税率 + 申报币种</td>\n<td>销项税</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资金层</td>\n<td>实际支付金额与账面负债的差额</td>\n<td>记账币种</td>\n<td>汇兑损益</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三层各自独立计算、独立记录、独立对账，只在最后的报表汇总时按科目相加。这种分离会让实现看起来多几步，但它是唯一能在稽查与审计中站得住的结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计算实例\">计算实例</h2><p>把上面的框架落到一个具体数字上。假设卖家记账币种是 EUR，买家以 SEK 支付。</p>\n<p>原交易：标价 120.00 EUR（含 25% 瑞典 VAT），下单时 EUR/SEK = 11.30，买家支付 1 356.00 SEK，其中税额部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>125</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24.00</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120 \\times 25/125 = 24.00</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25/125</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24.00</span></span></span></span></span> EUR。</p>\n<p>退货发生：EUR/SEK = 11.56。</p>\n<p>按上一篇 <a href=\"../multicurrency-refund-fx/refund-fx-rate\">退款汇率取原单还是当日</a> 的默认口径，<strong>买家侧退回 1 356.00 SEK</strong>（原支付金额），资金层无差异。</p>\n<p>税务层：税额冲减按原单口径，冲减 24.00 EUR 的销项税。这个数字不因汇率变动而改变，它的含税额拆分依据见 <a href=\"../multicurrency-refund-fx/refund-amount-tax-excl\">退款金额含税拆分</a>。</p>\n<p>但卖家记账时，1 356.00 SEK 的退款负债要折算成 EUR。这里出现关键分歧：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若负债按<strong>原单隐含汇率</strong>（11.30）折算，负债 = 120.00 EUR，与当初入账相等，支付 1 356.00 SEK 时按 11.56 折算只需 117.30 EUR，产生 <strong>2.70 EUR 汇兑收益</strong>。</li>\n<li>若负债按<strong>退款确认日汇率</strong>（11.56）折算，负债 = 117.30 EUR，支付时也是 117.30 EUR，<strong>无汇兑损益</strong>，但这意味着负债从一开始就小于原入账，差额在负债确认那一刻就作为损益计入了。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这两种做法在<strong>总损益上等价</strong>（都是 2.70 EUR 收益），差别在于<strong>何时确认</strong>。第一种做法在支付时确认（已实现），第二种在确认负债时确认（相当于立即确认）。会计准则通常要求外币货币性项目在初始确认时按交易发生日汇率折算，因此第一种更常见。工程上要选一种并保持一致，绝不能同一系统里两种混用——混用会让同一类退款的损益确认时点不可预测，月度损益波动无法解释。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>第一种做法（负债按原单汇率）</th>\n<th>第二种做法（负债按确认日汇率）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>确认负债</td>\n<td>120.00 EUR（汇率 11.30）</td>\n<td>117.30 EUR（汇率 11.56）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期末重估（若未支付）</td>\n<td>按期末汇率</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付结算</td>\n<td>117.30 EUR，已实现收益 2.70</td>\n<td>117.30 EUR，无损益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>损益确认时点</td>\n<td>支付日</td>\n<td>负债确认日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总损益</td>\n<td>+2.70 EUR</td>\n<td>+2.70 EUR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>汇兑损益是「同一经济事项在不同时点按不同汇率折算」的必然差额，不是错账或手续费，必须识别并计量。</li>\n<li>产生条件是<strong>负债确认时点与结算时点分离</strong>；退款流程的审批、凭证等待、通道处理天然制造这个时差。</li>\n<li>必须区分未实现（期末重估货币性项目）与已实现（实际收付）损益；退款负债必须以原币记账并在期末重估，否则未实现损益会丢失。</li>\n<li>税务冲减额<strong>不参与汇兑重估</strong>，它按申报口径固定；把它拉进重估会同时污染税务与会计数据。</li>\n<li>汇兑损益按币种对、业务事件类型、法人主体三维归集；退款损益在退货率上升时放大，高退货品类 + 弱币种需专门监控。</li>\n<li>交易层、税务层、资金层必须三层分离，各有币种口径与科目；三层独立计算与对账，只在报表汇总时相加。</li>\n<li>负债折算可选用原单汇率或确认日汇率，总损益等价但确认时点不同；必须全系统统一选一种，不能混用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"汇兑损益记账","id":"汇兑损益记账"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"已实现与未实现：两种损益的区分","id":"已实现与未实现-两种损益的区分"},{"level":2,"text":"落位：汇兑损益记在哪里","id":"落位-汇兑损益记在哪里"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么不能和税务冲减混在一起","id":"为什么不能和税务冲减混在一起"},{"level":2,"text":"计算实例","id":"计算实例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"退款汇率取原单还是当日","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/refund-tax-adjustment/multicurrency-refund-fx/refund-fx-rate"},"next":{"title":"退款金额含税拆分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/refund-tax-adjustment/multicurrency-refund-fx/refund-amount-tax-excl"}}